Huaputa tuhi: (['a:b:'] - [':']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (['Lorem Ipsum'] - ['Ipsum']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (['a.................b.......................c...........'] - ['.']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (['a--b--c---d'] - ['--']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (['-'] - ['--']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ([''] - ['--']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: (['--'] - ['']), rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: ([''] - ['']), rārangi-hou.
>> x := ['xx'].
>> y := x - ['x'].
Huaputa tuhi: x, rārangi-hou.
Huaputa tuhi: y, rārangi-hou.
>> x := ['a,bb,c'].
>> y := x whakakapihia: [''] me: ['xx'].
Huaputa tuhi: ((x ōrite-pū: y) tēnei: ['OK'] tērā-rānei: ['BUG! Did return a copy by accident!']), rārangi-hou.